# Core logs location

- Core (backend) logs live under `/home/informatics/prod/logs/core/`.
- You can inspect logs at **`/home/informatics/prod/logs/core/informatics.log`** (primary tail-friendly file).
- Rotated files may appear as `informatics-YYYY-MM-DD.log` in the same directory; use those when investigating a specific date.

